{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d50f12259053668caf0983a690ee9af86c33769c73ef188920a2e9c8855f0419",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "text": "甜香、努力与友情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1659fe408b29902069f8b82e8b25074eaf56919370699503e58e598161628e68",
      "text": "最近朱雀很在意玄武身上飘着一股甜甜的香味。\n但玄武却说自己毫无头绪。\n然而，其实玄武是在为了朱雀的生日\n秘密做着某项准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "text": "甜香、努力与友情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cfa5ebcf8a80785fc33a49a14a9b4f5a88e4c732a2d7f864699028753d9deea",
      "text": "……以上就是今天的碰头会内容。\n有什么让您在意的点吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ca511159535dfb1a609d85c01d048049b34b9b29e7e7035de4d3ac254b47c2",
      "text": "哦！没问题！……不对，虽然不是工作上的事，\n但我有点在意的细节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f692e360bfe56a9bdc2593726835873ddb4d6a7d9d090e5e50b46deb0864f10",
      "text": "好的，请尽管直说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b22c959ce2b9cce260d4023c3e36ce7e5bae6946b8b5d9d44e2dfbcc3d9945",
      "text": "谢啦！制作人啊，\n你最近有没有闻到玄武身上有股甜甜的香味？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f356938bfe059fd97ed9a2c7fa9f89ddc3f1e92452739605e5ae09cbdb80598f",
      "text": "甜甜的香味……\n会吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:471237ba7c0b105fdfb7cd2b3606b6382209d6e624865799bbd65d895244be45",
      "text": "制作人没注意到啊。\n那可能是我的心理作用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2c23d6cc05a227d831aca75b8191379e54e73715d1c8335821d786db44407c4",
      "text": "去问玄武本人，\n他也说“有那种味道吗？”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20212e729006dbfa1d6f97ee816d7b557455f016bb142f20741a71f7f4eda1a9",
      "text": "算了，不管了。看来是我弄错了。\n不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b00cfff88820e68146058a036c6ba94b2882bd289284532c50227dd1b58e154",
      "text": "喵～～～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018e1149c0f61f7488e9f92ccc6bc00635cf209e8e6188b48f2181328cc331cb",
      "text": "（喵子好像欲言又止的样子……\n保险起见还是向玄武先生确认一下比较好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44deaffc038ce5300b230b60ce2f88cf6d83bd72879638b98c2be84df730358e",
      "text": "怎么啦喵子，肚子饿了吗？\n那就去吃饭吧。制作人，回头见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f466959b384a6122bfb71493baa3fc3836b36ad31ffca7b7eda120ee873b3c",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdd5410cd276e92d53c09df1467e3d66b952d00d737c2b84daeb0efa3cfd353",
      "text": "……就是发生了这样的事。\n玄武先生，您对此有头绪吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29194fa9dac18cc17ac6c9b92a0ac82e3ff8e6043b44da0f961dd77026b575ba",
      "text": "啊啊，朱雀那家伙，\n果然还是去找番长了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f68cae3610ac5211d5f33759618fdd88bf7a5f8b4361e65fec6add5427a90354",
      "text": "毕竟看他当时隐约还在挂念着的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1727323dc3ca1daf4a509efd005a04e056be6bf0ab1d46bcb9c7b3ffacf03c3d",
      "text": "这么说来，果然是有什么隐情？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e942bf08972ce554cfedb3614a380b172da196990876fea628054091c1cec66d",
      "text": "虽然我不想瞒着他，\n但还有件事想再稍微保密一阵子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd2fe72d9a32e4ecfdc451b3deb3b42f833f861848a210b167b1fcc8dc0107e",
      "text": "马上就到朱雀的生日了对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eca607204d9655fc17119baf38a6654fb2517315de61b45de7fa596cfef74cdc",
      "text": "难道说……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78e640d1e35081449b907c83534b6842be0632479cf7fe020cd3dcd986ad601e",
      "text": "嗯。难得是大喜的日子，\n想让他吃点喜欢的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80781a96a39b4b3db57dd36ff94b7fd5444ecccce7b498cfad9370c0d2c7cdd4",
      "text": "这么一想，果然第一个浮上心头的就是松饼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a86e8538ce3ea971f3e355b43c0bf1b8a891dfbdf61619c59418e6c0cfc079",
      "text": "所以我想为他烤松饼。\n但试了好几种食谱，总觉得都不太对味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e955e2d7e8020b7974131b128e2e5cff27ba1bb6e2c3dab280797e38564ca33",
      "text": "反复练习了好多次，\n所以那味道大概就沾到身上了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb5ff555f58ec824c616e07b3a2a779335de1c08698874432d48a953c340323",
      "text": "原来是这么回事！我明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb760e3d7e277d5afdd7cc5911e0c93b86e3b0db63b9fb5fe2e121efa45b739d",
      "text": "不过我记得玄武先生平时有自己做饭吧？\n应该不至于不擅长做料理才对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cfba06c85c75c5c4a4210e88bc7d195bdf8efedf8acfb279bb2ebc6f4699333",
      "text": "算是吧。\n但一到松饼上就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:024840e75bd0f0e92ce72a8bec1e0a95a61cfae94e82206944d515c28ce15363",
      "text": "大概是因为常陪着朱雀去那些有名气的店，\n舌头也被养刁了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:785a3b550d3f3cdabb8762f76fe015b84e78f432a230cb62453fc274e4d349ce",
      "text": "怎么也做不出能让我满意的味道。\n虽说积土成山，我也在不断反复尝试就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0afa4fb42772308d7d98132a8e07d1dbf5b19d3ddd494c54b172995a1e0a246",
      "text": "多亏这个，这段时间每天晚上，\n饭吃的都是试做的松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ad1c088731a0507dfff248e20523c530a4a3abe8a5f69cbdf283496104e154e",
      "text": "既然这样，要不要向英雄先生请教一下？\n他很懂怎么做松饼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232bc26fe53b75115aa056f0e45fa73adb99b327e1712c957db16d1fe2b818e4",
      "text": "英雄大哥？那我还真是头一次听说。\n谢了。回头我试着联系他看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b13709029462b365b87dafd91776758b473f56ef98053e7d389c12c2be20f2",
      "text": "好的。顺便问一下，为了不让朱雀先生担心，\n我能先在不穿帮的程度内跟他聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c10bf4ab572e66c685d99d6fe4a39e9a1c5ca2aedc99f035206f7ee0fa260f",
      "text": "那件事我也一直挂在心上。\n就交托给番长了。多谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e576bc92f61836df87466ef15fcaea04a2b2805d6968ce09466b55a1753b027",
      "text": "希望当天能过一个美好的生日呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6949d1a08153b3b798fda86daecfd5ac6a4307d08570f11f829bbfec8935db4",
      "text": "啊啊。……对了番长。\n顺便还有件事，能帮我个忙吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c55a8c776a58c7bd3bdf085da1abdb3ad3421c3a8ddab7e9ab99973e4b787450",
      "text": "嗯～今天也总觉得闻到了玄武身上有甜味啊。\n喵子你是不是也这么觉得？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:991bfd11b7768a189496f62ff0ffb8994f7007c3505eeb2f6615fd65e50950e4",
      "text": "唔喵～～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758700cd451fe64be824c035790be2fe4ef9b91067280eae9e13cf2150b3bfef",
      "text": "啊，关于那件事……玄武先生他，\n最近好像出于兴趣迷上做点心了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d5f4a8c43dbd4e3726007268cfa75a7d0bb2dd0234210749ad5873d3a323ca6",
      "text": "点心？？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01c1fee95d57df0ff654c29df53057a5807116acb53c2b5ec33dbfe6e3281a01",
      "text": "听说是在书上看到，不知不觉就感兴趣了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f93af1b64a50c32de1ee778c4bcb327a243777c9829a83d893abff62a78af8bb",
      "text": "搞什么嘛，原来是这样啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3500e44d44380683d9f978b6b7b88d3067941c493af5b9239e149d202ab72048",
      "text": "那就说得通了。不过玄武那家伙真是见外。\n不藏着掖着直接跟我说不就好了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eab00cc3f701682d7e97ccb4bdc58d3cbd86c8b179334746db7503de6f3218e",
      "text": "我想他一定是打算做出满意的成果之后\n再告诉你的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:349ce7fb31b250c0a59c299e636264aa2b344c0191f811c85b65265c4146bdde",
      "text": "哈哈，是吗！\n这种地方玄武也是帅气得很哪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e80a3f7a9f18e24b28f9ce536aa065d41a3afff65a606a54385e10799371ba",
      "text": "说起来，朱雀先生。\n临时插进了一个单独的碰头会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9affde22750dc76aba79e92fb7b6c30016e24a877daac1249dc83e5acd589c25",
      "text": "4号放学后，\n能请你来休息室一趟吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9073b1303e61d577a2aa47a45e42b8eb2c94f50039c42c25134ec5c9c96a5df9",
      "text": "好嘞！\n4号对吧，我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9903256934d769cf47ed1aa8bc4f437170ba12d10ffb9e3879938a659998e5",
      "text": "辛苦啦，制作人！\n所以，今天的碰头会是关于什么的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f04bce7348c636b61650ff355963b2d26328b4900ce41865b34780cef3b086d",
      "text": "现在还在准备中。\n请稍等片刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd1d1bc31d0db99dc3f2ec8cae88d180c3e31fcafe1386bb25908d261b60c5f",
      "text": "让你久等了，朱雀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c9e8b30e79987b83828222db8ea184487915f252696b18317d7db56b38570d",
      "text": "玄武？嗯？你手里拿的那个是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b73d4af6e2e87b471d1c8756ba6309f4547bcacb58fafb7d72593d0b06998b0",
      "text": "生日快乐，搭档。\n我为你烤了松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e48fb661c5e43258b94ca8227bf0f093750dfe81fc8ad25af5bec353207061c8",
      "text": "为、为我……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e19fa0cbcb16f9ea777730b360af2b6bddfd7f405f8ffad9b3ba27139fc6522e",
      "text": "这样啊，今天是……这么说来，\n碰头会其实是为了给我庆祝！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:185777f8fa012d68149cb975a3ee2e93ebe2060719987cd5932b7131016e4302",
      "text": "是的。\n我帮忙筹划了这个惊喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d89e829c87c28c16752aa2c4a441c6a5e03a176f2dc39ae8565aae1d8065c13b",
      "text": "那难不成，\n最近闻到的甜甜味道也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29503552a06617e496be12cb44ddbf83719dd624de9e6f26ac08ec179c3d33a3",
      "text": "制作人说的\n你迷上做点心也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0538b9ecc2593f5da994d4ac1c3eb0ef4fd9b7a774d9dafbfc12bf16bcdf85",
      "text": "抱歉啊，唯独这件事我想保密。\n所以借了番长一点力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e924f5492c98b06941a083a32343084619321ee318bf46d24b262696fa9fae8",
      "text": "趁热吃吧。\n这可是到现在为止做得最棒的一块了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d975667641ef6d975039a5b41d3bf2666edd6c7fa1344d163b83ab6f684fe86a",
      "text": "我太高兴了玄武！\n那我就不客气地……开动啦！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59d295441e05ae8719baa9a0cfdb06b9ec656be584ea24ac1ab25408836cec35",
      "text": "……好吃！我还是第一次吃到这么好吃的松饼！\n可恶，眼眶都要湿了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a93df6fcb295fde7fcc93a26837ddacd71438c6d8ffa96805c7e8bb2a5d714",
      "text": "能让你这么高兴真是太好了。多亏了英雄大哥\n教我的特制配方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a39613e4a08af7a941c1609a24938a68ab8489ef1d7bf6aaba44bbf9958068f",
      "text": "虽说也有那个原因啦。但我觉得，\n果然还是因为包含着玄武炽热的心意啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e86bda2e6f80c8c2e9ae9b6893164d3540a00aec38d4d6a107d38c47b18942",
      "text": "真的太感谢了，玄武！\n你果然是我最棒的搭档！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
